WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.334
-Today's Friday.
-Really?

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:04.601
-Yeah, that's usually when I
catch up on some personal stuff.

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:05.767
-Really?
-Oh, yeah, I get my --

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:07.801
-What else do you do?
-Well, I check my inbox,

00:00:07.801 --> 00:00:09.868
return e-mails, of course
I send out thank you notes.

00:00:09.868 --> 00:00:11.534
It's Friday.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:12.767
Would you guys...?

00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:16.234
Would you guys mind
if I wrote out

00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:17.601
some thank you notes tonight?

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:19.434
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Right now?

00:00:19.434 --> 00:00:20.667
-Now.
-Now?

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:22.267
-Yeah, in the middle
of the show.

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:23.701
-Wow.

00:00:23.701 --> 00:00:25.934
-James, can I get some thank you
note writing music, please?

00:00:25.934 --> 00:00:27.067
I would love some.
[ Piano music playing gently ]

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:29.367
-Oh, my God.
-Yeah.

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:31.267
Why is it...?

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:33.434
-Wow. That's the
Miami Sound "Asleep" Machine.

00:00:33.434 --> 00:00:35.400
-Yeah. Why is he...?
[ Laughs ]

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.567
Why is he so excited?
-I don't know.

00:00:37.567 --> 00:00:38.734
He loves the conga.

00:00:38.734 --> 00:00:40.334
-Yeah. [ Chuckles ]

00:00:41.968 --> 00:00:43.734
♪♪

00:00:43.734 --> 00:00:47.234
Thank you, Ron DeSantis,
for being on a mission

00:00:47.234 --> 00:00:49.601
to destroy two Donalds --
Trump and Duck.

00:00:49.601 --> 00:00:52.634
[ Laughter, applause ]
-[ Imitates Donald Duck ]

00:00:52.634 --> 00:00:54.000
-[ Imitates Donald Duck ]

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:57.634
Uh...

00:00:57.634 --> 00:00:59.167
♪♪

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:02.434
Thank you, Prince Harry
and Meghan Markle's eviction

00:01:02.434 --> 00:01:04.434
from the royal residence,

00:01:04.434 --> 00:01:07.234
for leading to the most epic
U-Haul procession ever.

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:09.000
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.267
Get it out of here!

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.367
-[ Imitates trumpets playing ]

00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:17.167
♪♪

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:19.434
-Thank you,
Mandalorian helmet,

00:01:19.434 --> 00:01:23.234
for looking like Iron Man
with Ozempic face.

00:01:23.234 --> 00:01:25.934
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:01:27.667 --> 00:01:29.300
-Ozempic face.
-Ozempic face.

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:30.834
-Vitamin O.
-[ Chuckles ]

00:01:32.434 --> 00:01:34.100
♪♪

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:37.934
Thank you, Subway building new
restaurants with playgrounds,

00:01:37.934 --> 00:01:40.968
for being perfect for anyone
who's walked into a Subway

00:01:40.968 --> 00:01:43.300
and thought, "If only
my kids could play here."

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:45.801
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:01:45.801 --> 00:01:48.400
-I guess not.
-♪ I can dream ♪

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.634
♪ I can dream ♪

00:01:50.634 --> 00:01:52.367
♪ I... ♪
The National's here!

00:01:52.367 --> 00:01:54.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:58.634 --> 00:02:00.467
♪♪

00:02:00.467 --> 00:02:01.868
Thank you,

00:02:01.868 --> 00:02:05.634
Japan finding 7,000 islands
it didn't know existed,

00:02:05.634 --> 00:02:09.701
for being the global version of
finding $20 in your coat pocket

00:02:09.701 --> 00:02:10.801
and you're like...

00:02:10.801 --> 00:02:12.067
-Hey!
-Awesome!

00:02:12.067 --> 00:02:13.534
[ Applause ]

00:02:13.534 --> 00:02:15.334
-Nice!
-Do the conga!

00:02:15.334 --> 00:02:16.267
-Do the conga on this.

00:02:18.434 --> 00:02:19.834
♪♪

00:02:19.834 --> 00:02:22.501
-Thank you,
powdered donut holes,

00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:24.501
for looking like something
Cocaine Bear

00:02:24.501 --> 00:02:26.968
left behind on the trail.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.968 --> 00:02:29.200
-Whoa. Whoa!

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:31.267
Hello.

00:02:31.267 --> 00:02:33.067
-That's exactly it.
-That's it.

00:02:33.067 --> 00:02:35.100
-That's it.
-That's Cocaine Bear scat.

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:36.534
-That's it.

00:02:36.534 --> 00:02:38.300
[ Chuckles ] Scat.
-[ Indistinct ]

00:02:39.901 --> 00:02:41.234
♪♪

00:02:41.234 --> 00:02:44.567
-Thank you, pistachios,
for being nut clams.

00:02:44.567 --> 00:02:48.033
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:02:48.033 --> 00:02:49.801
-That sounds filthy.

00:02:49.801 --> 00:02:51.334
This is a family show!

00:02:51.334 --> 00:02:53.467
-Nut clams.
-Nut clams?!

00:02:53.467 --> 00:02:56.200
-[ Laughs ]
-Wait a second.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:57.901
I thought you were being clean.

00:02:57.901 --> 00:03:00.501
-We got one more joke.
-One more? Oh, my God.

00:03:00.501 --> 00:03:01.868
-You think I can't top that one?

00:03:01.868 --> 00:03:03.400
-You got to top nut clam.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:05.701
-Oh, no way, man.

00:03:05.701 --> 00:03:07.801
-Clam it up, G.
-Here we go.

00:03:07.801 --> 00:03:09.033
Here we go, G.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.367
♪♪

00:03:11.367 --> 00:03:13.000
-Thank you, KFC,

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.968
for bringing back your
Double Down sandwich...

00:03:15.968 --> 00:03:18.133
right in time for the finale
of "The Last of Us."

00:03:18.133 --> 00:03:19.467
There you go, everybody.
Thank you!

00:03:19.467 --> 00:03:20.467
Those are our thank you notes.

